      "stats_desc": "7 sections: overview, descriptive stats, inferential stats, effect sizes (the actually-meaningful number), reliability, validity, common research pitfalls. Stats literacy is the difference between consuming research critically + being manipulated.",
      "sternberg_s_triarchic_theory": "Sternberg's Triarchic Theory",
