      "often_clear_or_nearly_so_fine_if_you_h": "Often clear or nearly so. Fine if you have not been pushing fluids; overdrinking water has its own risks.",
      "omega_3_depression_iron_adhd_style_fat": "Omega-3 + depression, iron + ADHD-style fatigue, sugar crashes, caffeine + adolescent anxiety, gut-brain axis. Contributing factors, not cures.",
