      "solar_battery": "Solar + battery: ",
      "solar_charges_battery_during_arc_time_": "Solar charges battery during arc time. Replaceable batteries (lithium) are better than non-replaceable.",
      "sole_proprietorship_or_llc_175_filing_": "Sole proprietorship or LLC ($175 filing in Maine). Sales tax permit (Maine Revenue Services). EIN if hiring. Not complicated.",
      "solid_wire_er70s_3_s_6_on_spool_shield": "Solid wire (ER70S-3, S-6) on spool + shielding gas (CO2, C25, argon mixes). Wire 0.024\" to 0.045\" typical.",
      "solid_wire_vs_c_for_composite_cored": "= Solid wire (vs C for composite/cored)",
